repository-code: "https://github.com/ZackaryLoevseth/Erd-s-Problem-409"
url: "https://github.com/ZackaryLoevseth/Erd-s-Problem-409"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducible computational research archive for Erdős Problem #409,
  including a complete 105-node pointwise certificate for
  F(400,000,287,233,629)=104, three evaluator paths, six mutation controls,
  the preserved F=68 through F=71 chain, and the separately scoped rooted
  inverse-totient tree for the earlier chain. No record priority is claimed.
keywords:
  - Erdős Problem 409
  - Euler totient
  - iterated functions
  - inverse totient
  - computational number theory
  - primality certificates
  - reproducible research
